      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Spring storms in Utah often cause roof damage by combining strong canyon winds, heavy rain, and lingering winter freeze-thaw wear that loosens shingles and creates sudden leaks\n\n.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "combining strong canyon winds, heavy rain, and lingering winter freeze-thaw wear that loosens shingles and creates sudden leaks"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Common Signs of Roof Damage"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Missing or lifted shingles: High winds tear away weakened or aging shingles, exposing the dark underlayment beneath."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Granules in gutters:\nHeavy rain and hail wash away protective shingle granules, leaving the asphalt brittle and prone to cracking."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Ceiling water stains: Yellow or brown spots on indoor ceilings or in the attic show that water is bypassing your roof's outer layer."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Dented vents or flashing:\nHail or flying debris can warp metal components and damage seals around chimneys and skylights."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "What to Do Next"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Inspect safely from the ground: Take wide and close-up photos of any visible roof flaws, gutter debris, or damaged siding to document the condition.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Cover exposed areas: Install a heavy-duty emergency tarp over missing shingle sections to prevent rapid indoor water damage.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              6
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Contact local professionals: Reach out to local experts like UDK Storm Damage Repair\nfor professional evaluations and emergency tarping services.",
            "snippet_links": [
              {
                "text": "UDK Storm Damage Repair",
                "link": "https://calludk.com/services/storm-damage-roof-repair/"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
